Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 744 "[Lemegeton] Archduke of 26 Legions"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900263000
    Collect 1 of 900264000
    Collect 1 of 900265000

Requires player level >= 73 and quest 743 is completed

Rewards
    Give 8750000 experience
    Give 30000 coins
    Give 1 of 900266000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I'm starting to see hope. Time for another trip to the other side. Go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I'm starting to see hope. Time for another trip to the other side. Go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Good time. I'm about to destroy the portal of the underworld."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The war is still in our enemy's favor but there's stil a hope. We must eliminate and seal [17Devil] Botis who controls 26 troops and his followers [41Devil] Focalor and [63Devil] Andras.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [17Devil] Botis, [41Devil] Focalor, and [63Devil] Andras."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Good time. I'm about to destroy the portal of the underworld."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The war is still in our enemy's favor but there's stil a hope. We must eliminate and seal [17Devil] Botis who controls 26 troops and his followers [41Devil] Focalor and [63Devil] Andras.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [17Devil] Botis, [41Devil] Focalor, and [63Devil] Andras."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    Say "I'll give you the last order. You have to seal [Devil 5] President Marbas, who has great fame even in Hell. He's a high-ranked devil who governs thirty-six legions. He's very dangerous and needs to be watched for, because he can cause and spread diseases. Go to [Eslant] with the [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] and destroy him after summoning him from the [Devil 5 Summoning Stone]. We'll have a chance to counterattack if he's removed."
